      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Host memory available",
      "description": "MemAvailable of the host and its total; the VM has 3.8 GiB and no swap. The line is HostMemoryLow's 512 MiB: the drift job needs up to 400 MiB for a run.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
